{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工程实践MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 性能优化的核心策略有哪些？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工程实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工程实践\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Agent 性能优化的核心策略有哪些？\" dir=\"auto\">Agent 性能优化的核心策略有哪些？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 系统端到端延迟高达 6 秒，用户反馈体验差。如何从延迟、Token、并发三个维度进行优化？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、延迟优化（目标 P50 &lt; 3s）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 流式输出：TTFT &lt; 500ms</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">stream_response</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"SSE 流式输出\"\"\"</span>\n    response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>astream<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> chunk <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">yield</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"data: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">'token'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> chunk<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\\n\"</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 检索并行化：多路检索从串行改为并行</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">parallel_retrieval</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"并行检索\"\"\"</span>\n    results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>gather<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        vector_db<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 向量检索</span>\n        elasticsearch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token comment\"># 关键词检索</span>\n        knowledge_graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token comment\"># 知识图谱</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> merge_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 模型路由：简单查询走快速模型</span>\nmodel_router <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"simple\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o-mini\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 延迟 800ms</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"medium\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>          <span class=\"token comment\"># 延迟 2000ms</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"complex\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"o1-preview\"</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 延迟 5000ms（但只需复杂查询）</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 连接池复用</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># HTTP 长连接、数据库连接池，减少连接建立时间 -50ms</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、Token 优化（降本 60%+）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">TokenOptimizer</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Token 优化器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">optimize_system_prompt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"System Prompt 精简\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 去除冗余描述、使用结构化格式</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 工具描述按需动态注入（不是每次都带全部工具）</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_compress<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">trim_context</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"上下文裁剪\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 保留 system + 最近 N 轮 + 早期摘要</span>\n        system_msg <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># system prompt</span>\n        recent_msgs <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 最近 3 轮</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 中间轮次压缩为摘要</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">8</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            middle <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_summarize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>middle<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>system_msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> recent_msgs\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> messages\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">limit_tools</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> available_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"只注入相关工具\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 根据意图只加载相关工具，减少 tool description token</span>\n        relevant <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>t <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> available_tools <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_is_relevant<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> relevant<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 最多 5 个工具</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、并发优化（吞吐量提升 200%）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 1. LangGraph 并行节点</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> StateGraph\n\nbuilder <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> StateGraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>AgentState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 三个检索节点并行执行</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"fetch_weather\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> fetch_weather<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"fetch_news\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> fetch_news<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"fetch_stock\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> fetch_stock<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>START<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"fetch_weather\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>START<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"fetch_news\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>START<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"fetch_stock\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 串行 2100ms → 并行 800ms，节省 62%</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 异步全链路</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># FastAPI + async/await，所有 I/O 操作异步化</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 批处理 + 指数退避防 Rate Limit</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">batch_process</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> processor<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> batch_size<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"批量并发处理\"\"\"</span>\n    results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> batch_size<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        batch <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> items<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> batch_size<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        batch_results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>gather<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>processor<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>item<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> item <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> batch<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>batch_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> batch_size <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sleep<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0.2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 限流保护</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> results\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、优化效果对比</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化项</th>\n<th>优化前</th>\n<th>优化后</th>\n<th>提升幅度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>平均响应时间</td>\n<td>3.2s</td>\n<td>0.8s</td>\n<td>-75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月 Token 消耗</td>\n<td>180M</td>\n<td>52M</td>\n<td>-71%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月 API 费用</td>\n<td>$2,700</td>\n<td>$780</td>\n<td>-71%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发吞吐量</td>\n<td>12 req/s</td>\n<td>38 req/s</td>\n<td>+217%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"流式输出时工具调用怎么展示？\"</strong> — 检测到 Action 时发送状态消息\"正在查询...\"，工具完成后继续流式输出</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"如何定位延迟瓶颈？\"</strong> — 链路追踪：意图识别耗时？RAG 耗时？LLM 调用耗时？</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}